---
layout: layouts/piece.njk
title: "The Café — Lansing Lions basketball program ad"
canvasW: "1050px"
canvasH: "600px"
pageCss: "/assets/css/studio/ad-lansing-lions.css"

tags: studio
studioTransparent: true
studioExportScale: 2
studioTitle: "Lansing Lions program ad"
studioCategory: "Print"
studioSize: "2100 × 1200 px PNG, transparent corners · business-card shape (3.5 × 2 in at 600 dpi)"
studioNote: "Our ad for the Lansing High basketball program (client 2026-11-12). The program sets business-card ads on a red or black page with a glow round each, so this is a self-contained teal card with rounded, see-through corners: it reads on either. Send the PNG; it scales down to any ad slot."
studioW: 1050
studioH: 600
studioOrder: 80
---
{#- The hero's teal ground and wordmark, so it reads as the same cafe as
    the website and the sign out front. No red text: it's on teal. -#}
<div class="canvas lionsad">
    <div class="lionsad-main">
    <div class="lionsad-frame"></div>

    <div class="lionsad-top">
        <div class="wordmark wordmark--light wordmark--hero lionsad-wordmark">
            {% inlineSvg "/assets/thecafe.svg", "", site.name %}
        </div>
        <p class="p-eyebrow lionsad-tag">Breakfast &amp; Lunch · Made to Order</p>
        <p class="lionsad-hours"><span class="p-label">Open {{ site.opening.hoursDays }}</span>
            <span class="lionsad-dot">·</span>
            {{ site.opening.opens.time | replace(":00", "") }} {{ site.opening.opens.meridiem }} – {{ site.opening.closes.time | replace(":00", "") }} {{ site.opening.closes.meridiem }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lionsad-catering">
        <p class="p-display-italic lionsad-cater-kicker">Feeding the team?</p>
        <p class="p-display lionsad-cater-line">We cater team dinners, banquets &amp; events</p>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lionsad-band">
        <p class="lionsad-phone">{{ site.phone }}</p>
        <p class="lionsad-contact">lvcafetogo.com<span class="lionsad-dot">·</span>{{ site.email }}</p>
        <p class="lionsad-address">{{ site.address.street }} · {{ site.address.locality }}, Kansas</p>
    </div>
</div>
